<view class="page">
  <view class="panel">
    <view class="panel-title">运行环境</view>
    <view class="info-row">平台：{{platform}}</view>
    <view class="info-row">系统：{{system}}</view>
    <view class="info-row">基础库：{{SDKVersion}}</view>
    <view class="info-row">store-home 能力：{{storeHomeSupported ? '支持' : '不支持'}}</view>
    <view class="info-row">store-product 能力：{{storeProductSupported ? '支持' : '不支持'}}</view>
    <view class="notice">{{environmentNotice}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="panel-title">当前配置</view>
    <view class="config-value">小店 AppID：{{storeAppId}}</view>
    <view class="config-value">商品 ID：{{productId}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="panel-title">店铺卡</view>
    <store-home appid="{{storeAppId}}" />
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="panel-title">商品卡</view>
    <store-product
      appid="{{storeAppId}}"
      product-id="{{productId}}"
      bindentersuccess="onEnterSuccess"
      bindentererror="onEnterError"
    />
    <view class="result">商品跳转结果：{{productEnterResult}}</view>
    <view class="hint">这里记录的是点击商品后的跳转结果，不代表商品卡初始加载结果。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="panel-title">判读说明</view>
    <view class="guide-item">两者都失败：重点检查小店 AppID、店铺状态和当前平台。</view>
    <view class="guide-item">店铺卡成功但商品卡失败：检查商品 ID、商品归属和上下架状态。</view>
    <view class="guide-item">开发者工具中的结果必须使用手机真机复核。</view>
  </view>
</view>
